{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"RASTER SPACE 0,1\n\nRASTER CLEAR\nRASTER 1, 0, 0, 480, \u0022Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Blue, Indigo, Violet, Red\u0022\n\nRASTER MODE 2,TRUE\nRASTER WRAP 1,TRUE\nRASTER GFXMODE 1,1\n\nFOR I = 2 TO 9\n  RASTER I, 0, Y, 40, \u0022Blue, White, Blue,\nNEXT I\n\nLOAD \u0022Graphics/Layer/FlowerMaskWhite.png\u0022\nFONT LOAD 0, \u0022Graphics/font.png\u0022, 32, 25\nFONT MAP 0, \u0022ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ!?:;0123456789@()\u00A3$%.\u2019[]\u201D,-\u0022\nFONT ZOOM 0,200,200\nFONT PRINT #0,0, 0, 134, \u0022HELLO AMOS\u0022\n\nRASTER INFO\n\nY = 0\nY2=0\nMainLoop:\n  INC Y\n  IF Y=360 THEN Y=0\n  FOR I = 2 TO 9\n    RASTER MOVE I, SIN(Y\u002BI*10)*220\u002B220\n  NEXT I  \n\n  RASTER MOVE 1,Y2\n  DEC Y2\n  IF Y2=-480 THEN Y2=0\nWAIT VBL\nGOTO MainLoop","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}